OL,3,AMajor US outlets suspend shared Trump
OL,4,Acoverage in protest at media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three US outlets have since said
OL,7,Fthey will sue the Trump administration
OL,8,Fin a bid to "defend the principle that
OL,9,Fthe government does not decide what the
OL,10,Fpress reports".
OL,12,FShortly after, the White House launched
OL,13,Fits own streaming channel, Trump TV,
OL,14,Fwhich operates a 24/7 feed of clips of
OL,15,Fthe president.
